    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>appiapp Carousel Block is the ultimate Gutenberg carousel solution, enabling you to create stunning and fully customizable sliders without any coding skills. With three different carousel types, you can design engaging content layouts effortlessly.</p>\n<p>Custom Content Carousel: Add any Gutenberg block, including text, images, buttons, and more.</p>\n<p>Image Gallery Carousel: Create elegant image sliders with lightbox support.</p>\n<p>Post Carousel: Automatically showcase your latest blog posts in a dynamic slider.</p>\n<p>🚀 Features:</p>\n<p>✅ Fully integrated with Gutenberg<br />\n✅ Supports Embla Carousel, Swiper JS, and CSS-only modes<br />\n✅ Adjustable navigation (arrows, bullets, progress bars)<br />\n✅ Lightbox support for galleries<br />\n✅ Query Loop integration for post carousels<br />\n✅ Advanced responsive settings<br />\n✅ Set different item counts per device (fully responsive)<br />\n✅ Add custom CSS &amp; JavaScript per carousel<br />\n✅ Override default settings for deeper customization</p>\n<h3>Want more?</h3>\n<p>🔥Unlock 40+ professionally designed premium carousel templates to speed up your workflow and create beautiful carousels in minutes.<br />\n<a href=\"https://www.appiapp-themes.com/advanced-carousel-slider-gutenberg-wordpress/carousel-pro-demos/?utm_source=plugin&amp;utm_medium=readme&amp;utm_campaign=free_plugin\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Discover Premium Templates</a></p>\n<p>Create modern, fast, and beautiful carousels in just a few clicks! 🎡🔥</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Go to Plugins &gt; Add New in your WordPress dashboard.</p>\n<p>Search for &#8220;appiapp Carousel Block&#8221;.</p>\n<p>Click Install Now and then Activate.</p>\n<p>Add the &#8220;appiapp Carousel Block&#8221; block in Gutenberg and start building amazing sliders!</p>\n<p>Alternatively, you can upload the plugin manually:</p>\n<p>Download the ZIP file.</p>\n<p>Go to Plugins &gt; Add New &gt; Upload Plugin.</p>\n<p>Select the ZIP file, click Install Now, and then Activate.</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='does%20it%20work%20with%20any%20theme%3F'>\nDoes it work with any theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes! appiapp Carousel Block is built for Gutenberg, so it works seamlessly with any WordPress theme that supports block editing.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20use%20my%20own%20custom%20styles%3F'>\nCan I use my own custom styles?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Absolutely! You can customize colors, fonts, and layouts directly from the Gutenberg editor or use additional CSS for advanced styling.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.0.0</h4>\n<p>Major update – appiapp Carousel now includes advance features! 🎉</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fully responsive with customizable breakpoints  </li>\n<li>Multiple layout options, including vertical alignment  </li>\n<li>Adjustable navigation (arrows, bullets, progress bars)  </li>\n<li>Lightbox support for image galleries  </li>\n<li>Query Loop integration for post carousels  </li>\n<li>Direct Gutenberg integration – no shortcodes needed  </li>\n<li>Optimized performance and stability improvements  </li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release with full Gutenberg integration</li>\n<li>Supports Embla Carousel, Swiper JS, and CSS-only modes</li>\n<li>Initial release – enjoy building amazing carousels! 🚀</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "appiapp Carousel allows you to create highly customizable carousels directly in Gutenberg. Build unique sliders for posts, images, and any block.",
    "description": "<p>appiapp Carousel Block is the ultimate Gutenberg carousel solution, enabling you to create stunning and fully customizable sliders without any coding skills. With three different carousel types, you can design engaging content layouts effortlessly.</p>\n<p>Custom Content Carousel: Add any Gutenberg block, including text, images, buttons, and more.</p>\n<p>Image Gallery Carousel: Create elegant image sliders with lightbox support.</p>\n<p>Post Carousel: Automatically showcase your latest blog posts in a dynamic slider.</p>\n<p>🚀 Features:</p>\n<p>✅ Fully integrated with Gutenberg<br />\n✅ Supports Embla Carousel, Swiper JS, and CSS-only modes<br />\n✅ Adjustable navigation (arrows, bullets, progress bars)<br />\n✅ Lightbox support for galleries<br />\n✅ Query Loop integration for post carousels<br />\n✅ Advanced responsive settings<br />\n✅ Set different item counts per device (fully responsive)<br />\n✅ Add custom CSS &amp; JavaScript per carousel<br />\n✅ Override default settings for deeper customization</p>\n<h3>Want more?</h3>\n<p>🔥Unlock 40+ professionally designed premium carousel templates to speed up your workflow and create beautiful carousels in minutes.<br />\n<a href=\"https://www.appiapp-themes.com/advanced-carousel-slider-gutenberg-wordpress/carousel-pro-demos/?utm_source=plugin&amp;utm_medium=readme&amp;utm_campaign=free_plugin\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Discover Premium Templates</a></p>\n<p>Create modern, fast, and beautiful carousels in just a few clicks! 🎡🔥</p>\n",
